        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The game's original story, involves Kazuma discovering a cursed ring that allows him to steal the underwear of others near him. He learns the only way to undo the curse would be through raising enough money. The game's \"Underwear Judgment\" system revolves the player controlling Kazuma in returning lost underwear to their rightful owners.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "La historia original del juego trata de Kazuma, que descubre un anillo maldito que le permite robar la ropa interior de las personas que tiene cerca. Aprende que la única forma de deshacer la maldición es reunir suficiente dinero. El sistema de «Juicio de la ropa interior» del juego consiste en que el jugador controle a Kazuma para devolver la ropa interior perdida a sus legítimos dueños.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2017",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
