        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "It's time for a Visual Novel Quest with a twist! Join Kazuma, a reincarnated adventurer, and spend turbulent days with his unfortunate party members. Prepare for waifus, dress-up and resource management and get ready for an Isekai comedy that’s out of this world!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Llega una aventura de novela visual con un giro! Únete a Kazuma, un aventurero reencarnado, y pasa días turbulentos con sus desafortunados compañeros de grupo. Prepárate para waifus, cambios de vestuario y gestión de recursos, ¡y para una comedia isekai de otro mundo!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2020",
